---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BlogCard from '../../components/BlogCard.astro';

const post = {
	title: "The Future of Web Development in 2026",
	description: "Explore the latest trends in web development, from AI-driven coding to the rise of edge computing and beyond.",
	date: "May 15, 2026",
	author: "Vivek Chavhan",
	category: "Technology",
  readTime: "8 min read"
};

const relatedPosts = [
  { title: "Mastering AI: A Comprehensive Guide", href: "/blog/sample-post", category: "AI", date: "May 12, 2026" },
  { title: "Designing for the Next Generation", href: "/blog/sample-post", category: "Design", date: "May 10, 2026" },
  { title: "10 Tips for Better CSS Performance", href: "/blog/sample-post", category: "Performance", date: "May 08, 2026" },
  { title: "The Rise of Edge Computing", href: "/blog/sample-post", category: "Tech", date: "May 05, 2026" },
];

const faqs = [
  { question: "What is the biggest change expected in 2026?", answer: "The integration of AI as a core architectural component rather than just a feature." },
  { question: "Will edge computing replace cloud?", answer: "It won't replace it entirely, but it will handle the majority of real-time application logic for better performance." }
];
---

<Layout title={`${post.title} | AstroBlog`} description={post.description}>
  <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
  <nav class="flex py-4 text-sm text-text-muted mb-8 border-b border-border-card/30">
    <ol class="flex items-center space-x-2">
      <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Home</a></li>
      <li><span class="mx-2">/</span></li>
      <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Blog</a></li>
      <li><span class="mx-2">/</span></li>
      <li class="text-text-main font-medium truncate max-w-[200px]">{post.title}</li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <article class="min-w-0">
      <header class="mb-12">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs">
          <span>{post.category}</span>
          <span class="w-1 h-1 bg-text-muted rounded-full"></span>
          <span class="text-text-muted">{post.date}</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text-main m-0 leading-tight mb-6">
          {post.title}
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">
          {post.description}
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-2xl mb-12">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-secondary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold">VC</div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-bold text-text-main">{post.author}</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-text-muted">Technical Writer • {post.readTime}</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- In this article (TOC) -->
        <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-text-main uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">In this article</h3>
          <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <a href="#paradigm-shift" class="text-base text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full"></span> The Paradigm Shift</a>
            <a href="#ai-driven" class="text-base text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full"></span> AI-Driven Development</a>
            <a href="#edge-computing" class="text-base text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full"></span> The Rise of Edge Computing</a>
            <a href="#conclusion" class="text-base text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full"></span> Conclusion</a>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none prose-headings:text-text-main prose-p:text-text-muted prose-strong:text-text-main prose-code:text-primary prose-pre:bg-bg-surface prose-pre:border prose-pre:border-border-card">
        <h2 id="paradigm-shift">The Paradigm Shift</h2>
        <p>As we navigate through 2026, the landscape of web development has transformed more in the last two years than in the previous decade. The integration of AI isn't just a feature anymore; it's the foundation of how we build and interact with the web.</p>
        
        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-primary bg-primary/5 p-6 rounded-r-xl italic text-xl text-text-main my-8">
          "The web of 2026 is no longer just a collection of documents, but a living, breathing ecosystem of intelligent agents and personalized experiences."
        </blockquote>

        <h2 id="ai-driven">AI-Driven Development</h2>
        <p>Large Language Models have evolved from simple code completion tools to comprehensive architectural partners. Developers now focus more on design intent and system logic, while AI handles the boilerplate and optimization.</p>
        
        <h3 id="edge-computing">The Rise of Edge Computing</h3>
        <p>Latency is a relic of the past. With the maturation of edge computing, application logic is now distributed globally, bringing compute power closer to the user than ever before. This has led to the death of the traditional loading spinner.</p>

        <div class="bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-2xl p-8 my-10 shadow-inner">
          <h4 class="text-primary font-bold text-xl mb-4 mt-0">Key Takeaways</h4>
          <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">→</span> AI as a core architectural component.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">→</span> Global distribution by default.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">→</span> Hyper-personalized user interfaces.</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-primary font-bold">→</span> The end of static layouts.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h2 id="conclusion">Conclusion</h2>
        <p>The future is bright, and it's being built with tools that prioritize speed, developer experience, and user delight. Astro continues to lead the way by providing the most efficient framework for content-driven websites.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Section -->
      <section class="mt-20 border-t border-border-card pt-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-main mb-8">Frequently Asked <span class="gradient-text">Questions</span></h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          {faqs.map((faq) => (
            <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-primary transition-colors duration-300">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-main mb-2">{faq.question}</h3>
              <p class="text-text-muted m-0">{faq.answer}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Comments Section Placeholder -->
      <section class="mt-20 border-t border-border-card pt-12 mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-main mb-8">Comments</h2>
        <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-2xl p-12 text-center text-text-muted italic">
          Comments are currently moderated. Join the discussion on our social channels!
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-20 border-t border-border-card pt-12 mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-8">Related Articles</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          {relatedPosts.map((p) => <BlogCard {...p} />)}
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Stay Updated (Moved to last) -->
      <section class="mt-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 to-secondary/10 border border-primary/20 rounded-3xl p-10 shadow-sm text-center">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4">Stay Updated!</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-muted mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">Get technical insights and the latest tutorials directly in your inbox.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 max-w-md mx-auto">
          <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" class="flex-1 bg-white/10 border border-border-card rounded-xl px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:border-primary" />
          <button class="btn-primary">Join Newsletter</button>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
